- Tag documentation
- New maintainer (LaTeX Project)

Version 1.2d
- New maintainer (Will Robertson)

Version 1.2a/b
- Changed license from LPPL v1.0 to v1.3
- Fixed minor typos

Version 1.1
- Added a general \Describe macro
- Added a general Code environment

